# Folder ID

Stable identifier for **this folder**. Auto-generated by the millwright-inspector-development-machine — **do not edit by hand**.

The `id` in the frontmatter above identifies the folder itself, not any file inside it, so the link survives the folder being renamed or moved. A quest cycle's `reference.md` records this ID to connect `journal/` → `quest/` → `workflow-stream/`.

Resolve an ID back to its current folder with `scripts/folder-id.sh resolve <id>`.
